@startuml Sequence_Authentification
!theme plain
autonumber

skinparam sequenceFontSize 11
skinparam sequenceArrowFontSize 10
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontSize 11
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 160
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam BoxPadding 6
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam NoteBorderColor #F9A825

title Diagramme de Séquence (1/4) — Authentification

actor       "Commercial"    as C
participant "Application"   as App
participant "Firebase Auth" as Auth
database    "Firestore"     as DB

C    -> App  : Ouvrir l'application
App  -> Auth : Vérifier la session

alt Session active
  Auth --> App : Utilisateur connecté
else Session expirée
  C    -> App  : Saisir email / mot de passe
  App  -> Auth : Connexion (email, mot de passe)
  Auth --> App : Token d'authentification
end

App  -> DB   : Charger profil utilisateur (uid)
DB  --> App  : nom, points, rang, photo
App --> C    : Afficher tableau de bord

@enduml
